{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvR93XuKQXhhmFAH8jQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Gonna open an account at פסגות and buy \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\". The page marked both of them \"הזול\". Fairly sure. The page says I'd have about **86,492 ₪** after 10 years. That's with the numbers that were already filled in: 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month, 7% a year, so 70,000 ₪ put in. I didn't change them. With my own 30,000 ₪ the result would be different, but I don't know what it would be.\n\n**What decided it:** the big box right at the top, \"הבחירה שלכם · ★ הזול 86,492 ₪\". Next to it the next-best pair gives 86,449 ₪, only \"‎−43 ₪\" less. So I figured the cheap one is cheap and picking a different one hardly matters.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** The heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\" was exactly what I came for. S&P 500 was already selected. I saw the sliders (סכום היום 10,000, הפקדה חודשית 500, 10 שנים, 7%). I'd have dragged סכום היום to 30,000, but this is screenshots, so it stayed where it was. Then the big numbers.\n- **Screen 2:** On the right, the account list starts with \"פסגות ★ הזול 0 ₪\". I know פסגות, so good. Everyone else is in minus: לאומי ‎−3,096, הפועלים ‎−5,021. On the left the fund list starts with ילין לפידות, \"הבחירה\". There was a row of colourful tags; I didn't read them.\n- **Screens 3–4:** The minuses just keep getting bigger, down to ‎−22,985 for מיטב טרייד. That freaked me out a bit about the banks. I skimmed the long list of funds and skipped the English ones with \"אין מחיר כאן\".\n- **Screen 5:** There was a red \"‎−23,766 ₪\" with \"בין… ל…\", which scared me off that fund. Under it was a block of text, \"למה חלק מהקרנות…\", which I didn't read. Got bored here and stopped; I didn't look at screens 6–10.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** דמי משמרת, נאמן, צוברת, מחלקת דיבידנד, מנוטרל מט\"ח, \"סל\" vs \"מחקה\", 4D / 4A, \"מס גם על שינוי 